WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.472
Running a care agency? Or looking for your next caregiving opportunity? Meet CareSys. One platform, with a workspace built around what you need.

2
00:00:12.472 --> 00:00:23.000
Are you a care agency owner, looking for a better way to manage your business? CareSys brings recruitment and daily operations into one workspace.

3
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:35.952
See what needs your attention, without jumping between separate systems. Give recruiters, schedulers, supervisors, and finance staff access to the work they're responsible for.

4
00:00:35.952 --> 00:00:49.312
Looking for the right people? Search approved caregiver profiles by work area and skill, manage applications, and invite candidates. Keep your recruitment decisions organized.

5
00:00:49.312 --> 00:01:02.048
Plan client visits, review time and leave, and keep care notes and incidents in your agency workspace. Assignment checks help flag overlaps and qualification requirements.

6
00:01:02.048 --> 00:01:15.408
Follow expenses, equipment custody, invoices, and receipts in the same platform. Export approved worked time for payroll preparation, with a clear record of reviews and decisions.

7
00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:27.280
Are you a caregiver looking for new opportunities? CareSys gives you a place to present your experience, explore available roles, and take charge of your next career step.

8
00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:42.680
Sign in and create your professional profile. Add your skills, qualifications, languages, and preferred work areas. When you're ready, approve your recruitment preview so authorized recruiters can discover you.

9
00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:55.104
Browse published vacancies and their work locations. Find an opportunity that suits you, apply through CareSys, and follow your application status as the agency reviews it.

10
00:01:55.104 --> 00:02:08.344
Respond to invitations, review offers, and decide what career history you share. Your profile stays with you across agency relationships, and joining a new team requires your permission.

11
00:02:08.344 --> 00:02:22.064
Check your account for application progress and agency decisions. See updates as agencies respond. Response times depend on the employer, so an immediate reply isn't guaranteed.

12
00:02:22.064 --> 00:02:35.016
For agencies, a clearer way to coordinate the business. For caregivers, a place to be seen and pursue opportunities. Explore the CareSys demo and discuss a pilot.

13
00:02:35.016 --> 00:02:47.272
CareSys currently has a working local web application. Android and iPhone apps, regional subscriptions, and commercial hosting are planned as the platform prepares for launch.
